## Common Issues

### "dotnet: command not found"
→ .NET SDK not installed or not in PATH. Reinstall and restart terminal.

### "Cannot connect to SQL Server"
→ Check SQL Server is running: `Get-Service -Name MSSQL*`

### "Port already in use"
→ Find and kill process: `netstat -ano | findstr :5001`

### Build errors
→ Clean and rebuild: `dotnet clean && dotnet restore && dotnet build`

